{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48808","headline":"和中丞奉使承恩还终南旧居 · 皇甫冉","name":"和中丞奉使承恩还终南旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轩车寻旧隐，宾从满郊园。\n萧散烟霞兴，殷勤故老言。\n谢公山不改，陶令菊犹存。\n苔藓侵垂钓，松篁长闭门。\n风霜清吏事，江海谕君恩。\n祗召趋宣室，沈冥在一论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48808.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48808","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}